{
  "title": { "zh": "查出坏帧", "en": "Catch bad frames" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "逐个给出每帧的内容字节（校验字节除外）：每个在后一个字节收全的那一拍给出，「收到」为 1；结尾旗标收完时「帧尾」为 1，「完好」说出这帧是否完好；其余各拍为「—」或 0。",
    "en": "Give each frame's content bytes, the check byte aside: each on the tick the byte after it is complete, with got 1. When the closing flag is complete, end is 1 and intact says whether the frame arrived intact. On every other tick, 「—」 or 0."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到这里为止，校验码护着的只是一个字节，线照样会翻位。一帧有几个字节事先不知道，校验码于是放在整帧内容的后面：前面补 5 个 0 凑成一个校验字节，和内容一起做位填充。收的一方要等这一帧结束，才知道最后收到的是校验字节。",
        "en": "So far a check has guarded a single byte, and the wire still flips bits. A frame's length is not known in advance, so its check goes after the whole content: five 0s in front make it a check byte, stuffed along with the content. Only when the frame ends does the receiver know the last byte was the check."
      }
    }
  ],
  "hint": [
    {
      "zh": "<part-ref to=\"deframer\"></part-ref>交出的每个字节，都可能是最后那个校验字节。",
      "en": "Any byte <part-ref to=\"deframer\"></part-ref> gives could be the closing check byte."
    },
    {
      "zh": "一个字节先留住，等下一个字节收全时再交出去。",
      "en": "Hold each byte back until the next one is complete, then pass it on."
    },
    {
      "zh": "帧尾那一拍，<part-ref to=\"crchold\"></part-ref>收进的应当只有内容字节的位。",
      "en": "By the frame's end, <part-ref to=\"crchold\"></part-ref> should have taken in the bits of the content bytes and nothing else."
    }
  ],
  "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }] },
  "outputs": [
    { "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "字节", "en": "Byte" } },
    { "name": "got", "label": { "zh": "收到", "en": "Got" } },
    { "name": "end", "label": { "zh": "帧尾", "en": "End" } },
    { "name": "ok", "label": { "zh": "完好", "en": "Intact" } }
  ],
